      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For me, the last time I attempted to purchase VRC+ to gift it, it worked and worked well. This is not always the case. In the past, I would be in PCVR mode and I would get entirely through checkout and then the payment would just spin for 5+ minutes and not go through. It appears that it may be that the Steam overlay is performance heavy on the computer or freezes up? I had this happen to a friend recently. My recommendation for him (because it worked for me to get VRC+) was to go into desktop mode. He left VRC, relaunched in desktop mode, purchased VRC+ through steam in game, closed VRC again, and launched again in PCVR mode.",
