      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also have that issue. It says that it will proceed to the payment information on steam, yet I get no notification, redirection or anything on my steam panel (not in VR nor on desktop view of steam).\n\nIt did eventually work on my 8th or 10th attempt.\n\nUsed the shortcut Steam adds to the desktop (steam://rungameid/438100 command line). Does not change when starting VRChat on Steam client / in SteamVR's 3D panel.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
