  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Steps:\n\nWhile in PC VR, select a user, and click \"gift vrchat+\" then with the 1 month option selected, press \"purchase gift sub for XXX\"\n\nIssue:\n\nAfter clicking this it often just spins, and nothing happens. No error messages or feedback on whether it failed or succeeded.\n\nOther:\n\nVRC is probably losing a lot of potential money from this. This whole process has a lot of unnecessary friction, and could be made better. A simple suggestion is to allow purchasing of VRC+ with VRChat credits to cut out all the third party stuff (steam, paypal, etc) so it can truly be a \"1 button press\" thing. \n\nIt's hard to debug since I don't want to hammer at an issue that costs real money, so I don't have more useful info. Sometimes it does succeed and works as intended, but that's rare.",
